<title>THAILAND: Thailand 1997 rice export target 5.0 mln tonnes. [CORRECTED 12:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Thailand 1997 rice export target 5.0 mln tonnes. [CORRECTED 12:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's commerce ministry said in a new report on Wednesday that it had set the nation's rice export target for 1997 at 5.0 million tonnes.</p>
<p>(Corrects 1997 rice export target figure from 5.35 million tonnes to 5.0 million tonnes)</p>
<p>Thailand was expected to export 5.2 million tonnes in 1996 against 6.0 million tonnes exported in 1995, it added.  </p>
<p>The report said Thailand's target for rice production in the whole 1996/97 (May-April) crop season would be 21.26 million tonnes versus a target of 22.02 million tonnes set for the 1995/96 season.</p>
</text>
